hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1000","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne Khaibar mein aik zameen paayi to wo us baaray mein Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se mashwara karnay ko aaye aur kaha ke Ae Allah ke Rasool! Mujhe Khaibar mein aik zameen mili hai aur aisa umda maal mujhe kabhi nahi mila, Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) us ke baaray mein kya hukm kartay hain? Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar tu chahay to zameen ki milkiyat ko rok rakhay, yani asal zameen ko, aur us, ki paidaawar, ka sadqa kar do. Phir Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne us ko us shart par sadqa kiya ke asal zameen na baichi jaye, na khareedi jaye, na wo kisi ki miraas mein aaye aur na hiba ki jaye aur us ko faqiron aur rishta daaron aur ghulamon mein, yani un ki azaadi mein madad denay ke liye, aur musafiron aur naatawan logon mein ya mehmaan ki mehmaani mein, aur jo koi us ka intezam karay wo us mein se dastoor ke mutabiq khaye ya dost ko khilaye, is mein koi gunah nahi ke wo us mein se maal bana le, yani usay apni milkiyat bana le. (Muslim). (Asal se murad munafa hai; yubtau se murad khareeda jaye; Muslim mein biha nahi hai; mutamawwil se murad maalik banana hai.)"
"1001","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi faut ho jata hai to us ka amal mauqoof ho jata hai magar teen cheezon ka sawab jaari rehta hai. Aik sadqa-e-jariya ka, doosray us ilm ka jis se log faida uthayein aur teesray naik bakht aulad ka jo us ke liye dua karay. (Muslim: 5/73). Baab: Jo mar jaye aur wasiyat na ki ho us ki taraf se sadqa."
